# Task brief template — not an authorized task

Replace the example metadata and fill the sections with current task facts.
Do not add provider-specific model or thinking fields.

## Objective

Describe the user's requested observable outcome.

## Baseline and scope

Record the inspected revision, relevant existing behavior, exact allowed paths
and effects, and what must remain unchanged. Include applicable design or API
evidence for the actual task; do not require unrelated project artifacts.

## Acceptance and verification

State success and negative cases, test scope, needed host/platform evidence and
how results will bind to the tested candidate. Record unavailable checks as
unverified rather than passed.

## Recovery and open decisions

Define reversible recovery where possible. Route changes of scope and high-risk
effects through the current host's human decision surface. This template itself
does not transfer authority, settle effects or authorize publication.
